1
00:00:00,470 --> 00:00:02,430
(Amy:)Where would I have picked up
an alien parasite?

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,340
(Howard:)There you are.

3
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:08,860
(Raj:)Oh, hey.

4
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:11,860
(Howard:)Let me ask you a question.
What are you most afraid of?

5
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:13,470
(Raj:)I don't know. Um...

6
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:14,670
(Raj:)Nuclear war.

7
00:00:14,670 --> 00:00:16,200
(Raj:)Accidentally being
buried alive.

8
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,200
(Raj:)Any of those movies where
you get that phone call

9
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,500
(Raj:)that says you're
going to die.

10
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:21,570
(Raj:)And then you do.

11
00:00:21,570 --> 00:00:23,410
(Howard:)No. Something very specific

12
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:24,640
(Howard:)that we both know you,

13
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:27,480
(Howard:)Rajesh Koothrappali,
are terrified of.

14
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:30,320
(Raj:)Well, type two diabetes
runs in my family.

15
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:31,450
(Raj:)The thought of
losing a toe...

16
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:33,440
(Howard:)Spiders!
You're afraid of spiders!

17
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:35,950
(Raj:)What the heck is this?

18
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:38,390
(Howard:)A jar with a big spider
in it, of course.

19
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:40,390
(Howard:)Bravery test.

20
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:44,430
(Howard:)First one to take his hand out
is the sidekick.

21
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,100
(Raj:)Are you crazy?

22
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,970
(Howard:)Perhaps.

23
00:00:49,970 --> 00:00:51,370
(Howard:)Are you scared?

24
00:00:51,370 --> 00:00:53,640
(Raj:)No. But it's a stupid test.

25
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:56,570
(Howard:)Oh, really?
What if the earth was in danger

26
00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:57,730
(Howard:)and the only way to save it was

27
00:00:57,730 --> 00:01:00,650
(Howard:)to stick your hand
in a jar with a spider?

